Bazzite Horizon
===============

Bazzite, plus a Hyprland login session named Event Horizon.
The shell binary is ryzendew's Event Horizon, built from the commit in
event-horizon.ref with -Dnative_march=false.

Plasma is still on the image. At the login screen, open the session menu
and choose Event Horizon. KDE remains available if the Hyprland session
misbehaves.

First login copies /usr/share/event-horizon/skel into ~/.config only when
those files are missing.
